Title: Cloud Infrastructure Journal: Day 2 - Navigating DNS Private Resolver vs. Private DNS Zone & RBAC Constraints.

Content:

Objective: Deployment of devdept.local and integration with Private Resolver.

The Conflict: Differentiating between the "Infrastructure" (Resolver) and the "Database" (Zone).

The Blocker: Identified a PIM/RBAC restriction where the lab environment required Entra ID P2 for role elevation.

Conclusion: Documenting the necessity of "Just-in-Time" access management when dealing with restricted cloud environments. This is a crucial observation for real-world production security.
